    },
    {
      "id": "claim_831e57bb68c947beb3d77f0d0eb04757",
      "statement": "A friendship only becomes usable for task delegation after the requester's record is accepted: the server's _on_task_request requires the sender record to have status accepted (otherwise FRIEND_NOT_FOUND), and the client's outbound _send guard for task_request requires the friend record to be accepted and the local permission matrix to allow the action (PermissionDeniedError) before any envelope leaves the machine.",
